-- Demo data for the public Release Sentinel deployment.
--
-- The hosted demo runs on a free database that is recreated periodically, so
-- the seed lives in a migration rather than in a one-off script. Flyway
-- replays it automatically on every fresh database and the demo comes back
-- with data already in place.
--
-- The three Checkout Service releases are built to exercise each branch of
-- QualityGateService.determineStatus:
--
--   4.2.0  19 passed, 1 skipped, no open high or critical defects   READY
--   4.3.0  17 passed, 2 failed, pass rate 85, one open high defect  AT_RISK
--   5.0.0  2 blocked executions and an open critical blocking bug   BLOCKED
--
-- Changing the execution results below changes the verdict the demo shows.
-- blocking_release follows the rule in Defect: critical defects block, the
-- rest do not.






-- 4.2.0: 19 passed, 1 skipped. Pass rate 95.0, no failures, no blocked runs.

